{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09346","headline":"再游西山 · 韦应物","name":"再游西山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南谯古山郡，信是高人居。\n自叹乏弘量，终朝亲簿书。\n於时忽命驾，秋野正萧疎。\n积逋诚待责，寻山亦有余。\n测测石泉冷，暧暧烟谷虚。\n中有释门子，种果结茅庐。\n出身厌名利，遇境即踌躇。\n守直虽多忤，视险方晏如。\n况将尘埃外，襟抱从此舒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}